&lt;p&gt;配置下面的设置&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://shi1iu.github.io/p/%E8%AE%BE%E5%A4%87%E6%A0%91overlay%E4%BB%8B%E7%BB%8D/assets/image-20260320094637107.png&#34;
